@startuml
title Candidate lifecycle (HubSpot candidate object)

[*] --> New : LeadFormSubmitted\n(Meta lead form completed)\n=> Candidate created

New --> Attempting
Attempting --> Connected
Connected --> Sending_Documents
Sending_Documents --> Qualified_By_Us : Screening_approved\n(Selection_Agent)

Qualified_By_Us --> Approved_By_Customer: Customer_approved\n(Customer)

Approved_By_Customer --> [*]

New --> Rejected
Attempting --> Rejected
Connected --> Rejected
Sending_Documents --> Rejected
Qualified_By_Us --> Rejected

note left of Qualified_By_Us
In this state, the candidate is visible
in the customer portal (based on company link).
end note

note left of New
In this state, the candidate is visible in the candidate
pipeline (lead object HubSpot) for the selection agent.
end note

@enduml
